<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian budget to help rates - Howard says.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian budget to help rates - Howard says.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Prime Minister John Howard said on Wednesday that the debt reductions detailed in the budget for 1997/98 would increase the downward pressure on interest rates.</p>
<p>&quot;All of that exerts further downward pressure on the conditions that affect interest rates,&quot; Howard told Australian Broadcasting Corp radio on the morning after the budget's release.</p>
</text>
